# A chat opened from Home, words typed and sent: the bubble, 正在发送 while it goes, then sent.
timeout 60000
tap 端到端测试
until =studio
until 发消息
shot 1-chat
tap 发消息
type 第一条来自 mbui 的消息 {T}
shot 2-typed
tap icon:arrow-up
# (the bubble while it goes, at once: it is still sending, not settled)
now until 第一条来自 mbui 的消息 {T}
now shot 3-sending
gone 正在发送
shot 4-sent
